# ── OS cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Obsidian ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The vault's .obsidian/ folder is per-vault. You may commit it (to share
# appearance/plugins across machines) — but the bits below are per-machine
# state that should never travel. Ignore just those, not the whole folder.
.obsidian/workspace*
.obsidian/cache
.obsidian/*.bak

# ── Editors / tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Wiki sources (raw/) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# By design, sources ARE committed — git is the backup, and the source ledger
# assumes every source is version-controlled. So raw/ is NOT ignored here.
# If you'd rather keep heavy binary media out of history, opt in per-type:
# */raw/**/*.mp4
# */raw/**/*.mov
# */raw/**/*.zip
